This folder contains the LUKE path scripts of the generic form path_xxx*.m, and the corresponding structure 
is stored in file PATH_LOCAL.mat. Here, 'xxx' is the name of the script, with no operand of Matlab (don't use +,-,etc)

Note that the script load_dkepath_yp.m do the job, which recognizes automatically the hostname, the matlab version
and the username. The structure is defined as follows:

machinename.username(path_profile).yyy

where path_profile = 1 or 2,3,... etc

The username is obtain in Matlab by doing the command: getenv('USER')
The machinename may be freely defined but with letters only.


